@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - ATM System

[*] --> GreetUser

state "Greet User" as GreetUser
GreetUser : entry / User arrives at the ATM
GreetUser : do / Display greeting message
GreetUser : exit / Proceed to next state

state "Check PIN" as CheckPIN
CheckPIN : entry / Card inserted and user enters PIN
CheckPIN : do / Verify PIN
CheckPIN : exit / Correct PIN or incorrect PIN

state "Invalid PIN" as InvalidPIN
InvalidPIN : entry / Incorrect PIN entered too many times
InvalidPIN : do / Keep card for security
InvalidPIN : exit / Abnormal termination

state "Cancel Operation" as CancelOperation
CancelOperation : entry / User cancels operation
CancelOperation : do / Return card to user
CancelOperation : exit / Normal termination

state "Display Options" as DisplayOptions
DisplayOptions : entry / Correct PIN entered
DisplayOptions : do / Display available options (withdraw, check info, transfer)
DisplayOptions : exit / Proceed to next state

state "Process Request" as ProcessRequest
ProcessRequest : entry / User selects request
ProcessRequest : do / Process selected request
ProcessRequest : exit / Normal termination

GreetUser --> CheckPIN
CheckPIN --> InvalidPIN : Incorrect PIN entered too many times
InvalidPIN --> CancelOperation : User cancels operation
CancelOperation --> [*]
CheckPIN --> DisplayOptions : Correct PIN entered
DisplayOptions --> ProcessRequest : User selects request
ProcessRequest --> [*]

@enduml
